# Brand source art. brand/v3-stickers is 85 MB of generated PNGs and the deck is
# another 8 MB: too heavy for the repo, and once in, git history keeps them
# forever. Back them up off this machine -- being untracked is not being safe.
# The exception is the source of an asset the site actually ships.
brand/v3-stickers/*
!brand/v3-stickers/oracle.png
brand/oddie-deck.pdf
brand/oddie-deck.html
